                <story-points>
                  <story-point caption='Globally, performance is strong overall, with the exception of Canada and Africa. We&apos;ve also identified that we are lagging in the technology category.' captured-sheet='sales market by quanity' id='1' />
                  <story-point caption='We examine global sales and note that in certain locations, sales are strong but profits are negative.' captured-sheet='global sales' id='2' />
                  <story-point caption='When we bring in Sales by category and subcategory and add a comment noting that after further investigation, we found that the furniture category - specifically in the tables category - is the culprit.' captured-sheet='sales by category' id='3' />
                  <story-point caption='We recommend that management take steps to examine why performance is weak in these areas.' captured-sheet='Dashboard 1' id='4' />
